    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/9f709036468d7a5dc6f197f07574f320.poster.avif?t=1746724636\" width=616 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/9f709036468d7a5dc6f197f07574f320.webm?t=1746724636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kaporanga is a <strong>free party game</strong> with minigames made to play with your family and friends of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online or locally, with total flexibility: connect multiple players per computer in any way you like \u2014 2 on one PC, 3 on another, 1 solo... it\u2019s up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/46e75cf492977cf08b8e8e791f99d5f5.poster.avif?t=1746724636\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/46e75cf492977cf08b8e8e791f99d5f5.webm?t=1746724636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/46e75cf492977cf08b8e8e791f99d5f5.mp4?t=1746724636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>OLD-SCHOOL MINIGAMES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the games you used to play in your childhood with neighborhood friends, like Simon Says, Hot Potato, Musical Chairs, Memory, along with modern games set in places you already know \u2013 or NEED to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/ce557e1451bf4260591ae3295486e699.poster.avif?t=1746724636\" width=616 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/ce557e1451bf4260591ae3295486e699.webm?t=1746724636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/ce557e1451bf4260591ae3295486e699.mp4?t=1746724636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>ACCESSIBILITY FOR EVERYONE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All mini-games are played using only the analog stick (or D-pad) and just 2 buttons! With different control schemes to be as accessible as possible, we also include a colorblind mode and narrated menus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/bf5b1ebd23cc93858678026abb021faa.avif?t=1746724636\" width=616 height=130 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There can only be one champion! Outsmart your friends, win the required number of minigames to come out on top, and raise that trophy high! <br><br><strong>LET\u2019S KAPORANGA!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/0cb1d455dc9cbfde308d9817bf0de1a0.avif?t=1746724636\" width=616 height=694 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/9f709036468d7a5dc6f197f07574f320.poster.avif?t=1746724636\" width=616 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/9f709036468d7a5dc6f197f07574f320.webm?t=1746724636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kaporanga is a <strong>free party game</strong> with minigames made to play with your family and friends of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online or locally, with total flexibility: connect multiple players per computer in any way you like \u2014 2 on one PC, 3 on another, 1 solo... it\u2019s up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/46e75cf492977cf08b8e8e791f99d5f5.poster.avif?t=1746724636\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/46e75cf492977cf08b8e8e791f99d5f5.webm?t=1746724636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/46e75cf492977cf08b8e8e791f99d5f5.mp4?t=1746724636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>OLD-SCHOOL MINIGAMES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the games you used to play in your childhood with neighborhood friends, like Simon Says, Hot Potato, Musical Chairs, Memory, along with modern games set in places you already know \u2013 or NEED to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/ce557e1451bf4260591ae3295486e699.poster.avif?t=1746724636\" width=616 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/ce557e1451bf4260591ae3295486e699.webm?t=1746724636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/ce557e1451bf4260591ae3295486e699.mp4?t=1746724636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>ACCESSIBILITY FOR EVERYONE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All mini-games are played using only the analog stick (or D-pad) and just 2 buttons! With different control schemes to be as accessible as possible, we also include a colorblind mode and narrated menus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/bf5b1ebd23cc93858678026abb021faa.avif?t=1746724636\" width=616 height=130 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There can only be one champion! Outsmart your friends, win the required number of minigames to come out on top, and raise that trophy high! <br><br><strong>LET\u2019S KAPORANGA!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/0cb1d455dc9cbfde308d9817bf0de1a0.avif?t=1746724636\" width=616 height=694 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Kaporanga is a local and online party game for up to 8 players of all ages, packed with mini-games set across iconic places in Rio de Janeiro. It\u2019s free and accessible! Grab your friends, cousins, even the parrot \u2014 and get ready for some wild fun and friendly chaos. Time\u00a0to\u00a0Kaporanga!",
